flow pushed
note """
The INGEST fixture. Its transport delivers NOTHING at all — Start opens the edge
and pushes no packet — so every datum that reaches the sink arrived through the
ingest the generated package exports.

THAT IS WHY THE TRANSPORT IS EMPTY rather than merely reduced. A fixture whose
transport also delivers proves only that SOME data moved; one whose transport
delivers nothing proves the ingest specifically, because with the ingest
unwired the program prints no token and the run fails on its deadline.
"""

source entry Feed()
transform tally Tally from entry
sink report Report from tally
